cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  quantum-structure-entanglement: entanglement structure of energy-predicting
  transformers on the disordered transverse-field Ising chain
message: >-
  Unpublished work in progress. Please contact the author before citing any
  result from this repository.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kulkarni
    given-names: Miheer Satish
    alias: miheer-smk
repository-code: "https://github.com/miheer-smk/quantum-structure-entanglement"
abstract: >-
  Experimental apparatus and pre-registration for measuring the entanglement
  entropy of the state represented internally by a transformer trained only to
  predict ground-state energies of the disordered transverse-field Ising model.
  Ground truth is computed two independent ways (exact diagonalization and a
  free-fermion Majorana solver, agreeing to 1.648e-11, spread 2.0e-15) and hypotheses are
  pre-registered with power analyses before any model measurement is taken.
  Companion arm to quantum-structure-sae, pinned as a submodule at an exact
  commit so the two arms share an identical data-generation pipeline.
keywords:
  - transverse-field Ising model
  - entanglement entropy
  - infinite-randomness fixed point
  - quenched disorder
  - transformer
  - mechanistic interpretability
  - linear probes
  - sparse autoencoders
  - exact diagonalization
  - free fermions
  - finite-size scaling
  - pre-registration
  - reproducibility
license: MIT
license-url: "https://github.com/miheer-smk/quantum-structure-entanglement#license"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-04"
